k to where we  were up 10 with seven minutes to go in  the super bowl and you know my reaction  to that is that's  the hard part the easy part is holding  that lead for the final seven minutes of  the super bowl it's ridiculously  difficult to get back to where you were  when that lead evaporated especially in  that division they had to go week by  week and grind it out and fight and  scratch and claw  to get to week 17  and barely beat the seattle seahawks  they lose that game to the seahawks  they're the five seed in the nfc and  they're not going to the super bowl as  the five seed not without those two home  games those two home games made all the  difference for the 49ers to get to the  super bowl so i think that there is a  real possibility that they don't win the  division this year and if they don't win  the division they're not going back to  the super bowl that doesn't mean they're  not going to be back in the super bowl  soon i think they've got a great roster  but look there's only two teams  uh in recent years that have lost a  super bowl not in recent years i think  ever right it was the dolphins right in  the early 70s and it was the patriots a  couple of years ago to lose the super  bowl and to come back the next year  and win the super bowl that is a rare  rare accomplishment and uh actually i  think the cowboys also did it right they  lost to the colts with the jim o'brien  field goal and then they came back and  make the dolphins the next year so  actually it happened twice right  dolphins lose to the cowboys after the  cowboys lost to the colts and then the  dolphins beat washington and then it  went all those years until the patriots  did it losing to the eagles and beating  the falcons it's not easy to do  to go back to zero and zero like rich  basaccia told you and do it all over  again when you ultimately didn't get the  prize the last time around and  everybody's gonna be gunning for the  49ers all right let's stay in the nfc  east for quest